Subject: [PATCH] btrfs: include terminator in root name table

The "BLOCK_GROUP_TREE" name is 16 characters long. The 16-byte array
therefore has no room for its terminating NUL, which GCC diagnoses and
which makes the value unsafe to use as a C string.

Upstream-Status: Pending

---
 fs/btrfs/print-tree.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/fs/btrfs/print-tree.c b/fs/btrfs/print-tree.c
index 5ec381e..c3a9d12 100644
--- a/fs/btrfs/print-tree.c
+++ b/fs/btrfs/print-tree.c
@@ -12,2 +12,2 @@
-	char name[16];
+	char name[17];
 };
